<title>USA: Talladega BOE, Ala. $1.3 mln won by Sterne Agee.</title>
<headline>Talladega BOE, Ala. $1.3 mln won by Sterne Agee.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sterne Agee said it won $1.350 million of Talladega Cty BOE, Ala., capital outlay warrants, Series 1997 A,with a net interest cost of  5.1312 percent.</p>
